# Orders & Realtime

## Order Lifecycle

```text
Customer submits → NEW → PREPARING → READY → FULFILLED
```

Only authorized kitchen staff (BARISTA+) may change order status. Customers cannot cancel after submission in MVP.

## Socket.IO Events

| Event | Trigger | Payload |
|-------|---------|---------|
| `order.created` | Customer submits | `{ orderId }` |
| `order.preparing` | Kitchen accepts | `{ orderId }` |
| `order.ready` | Kitchen completes | `{ orderId }` |
| `order.fulfilled` | Handed to customer | `{ orderId }` |

## Kitchen Display System

Four columns: **NEW → PREPARING → READY → FULFILLED**

Order card shows: order number, table, wait time, items, special instructions. Staff drag or click to advance status.

## Customer Notifications

In-app (WebSocket) + optional browser push: "Order received", "Being prepared", "Ready for pickup".
